{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-flora-shore","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"flora-shore-calgary-properties-dubai-islands","about":"Flora Shore Beachfront Residences at Dubai Islands is a 15-storey project by Calgary Properties, designed by Mimar Architecture + Engineering. It features 76 modern apartments that bring together coastal living and city convenience in one of Dubai’s most attractive island communities.Located on Island A of Dubai Islands, the development offers 2, 3, and 4-bedroom apartments designed with comfort and space in mind. With strong ROI potential, high-quality finishes, and a range of lifestyle amenities, Flora Shore is ideal for both living and investment.The project features premium amenities such as an infinity swimming pool, an open-air gym, a yoga retreat, an outdoor cinema, co-working spaces, and dedicated kids’ areas, all designed to foster a lifestyle of comfort, leisure, and community. Residents enjoy proximity to key destinations, including the Dubai Marina, Burj Khalifa, and Dubai International Airport, ensuring both accessibility and exclusivity.","price":2250000,"title":"Flora Shore","bitrix":{"id":1354,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Flora Shore","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Flora Shore","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Calgary Properties","project_location":"Dubai Islands"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Feature_d95e1e1b3e.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Feature_d95e1e1b3e.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.300117533641,"lng":55.298575524034},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Gallery_11_9f02f72c82.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Gallery_11_9f02f72c82.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Gallery_4_69f5b26101.